  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span><ruby>ᄑᆤ<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>렁<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>랑<rt>ˏ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/FY21UkQbUBQ?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>等<rt>단ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>愛<rt>애</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>等<rt>단ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>船<rt>준ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>回航<rt>훼항ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tân-ai’e láng, tân-bo-jún hue-háng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>飄浪<rt>ᄑᆤˉ렁ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>心情<rt>심ˉ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>真<rt>진ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>振動<rt>딘ˆ당ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    phiāu-lōng’e láng, sīm-jiéng jīn-tîn-tāng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>奈<rt>내ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>忍心<rt>띰ˆ심ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>將<rt>졍ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>放<rt>방</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bo-nāi’e goà, rîm-sîm jiōng-lî-pang\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>異鄉<rt>이형ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>為<rt>위-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>夜<rt>야-</rt></ruby><ruby>夜<rt>야ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>夢<rt>빵ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    i-hiông’e goà, wi-lì ya-yā bāng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>男兒<rt>람띠ˊ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>心聲<rt>심ˉ샬ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>아<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby> <ruby>飄浪<rt>ᄑᆤˉ렁ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>運命<rt>운먀ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lam-rí sīm-siâ̰, ā phiāu-lōng’e un-miā\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>論<rt>룬-</rt></ruby><ruby>霜<rt>승ˉ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>雪<rt>셓</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>抑<rt>얗</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>風<rt>헝ˉ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>寒<rt>괄ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\"><ruby>헤<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>算<rt>승ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>啥<rt>샬ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bo-lun-sn̄g-seh, yah-si-hōng-koá̰, hè lông-bo-sǹg-sià̰\n  </span>\n</span></p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>唯一<rt>위읻</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>心疼<rt>심ˉ턀</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>心愛<rt>심ˉ애</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>在<rt>재-</rt></ruby><ruby>꾼<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>夢中<rt>빵뎡ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    wi-it’e sīm-thia̰, si-sīm-ai’e jai-gûn-bang-tiông\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>不時<rt>붇ˆ시ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>叫<rt>교</rt></ruby>’됴 <ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>名<rt>먀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    pût-sí kio’tio gùn’e miá\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>等<rt>단ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>愛<rt>애</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>等<rt>단ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>船<rt>준ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>回航<rt>훼항ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tân-ai’e láng, tân-bo-jún hue-háng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>飄浪<rt>ᄑᆤˉ렁ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>心情<rt>심ˉ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>真<rt>진ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>振動<rt>딘ˆ당ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    phiāu-lōng’e láng, sīm-jiéng jīn-tîn-tāng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>奈<rt>내ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>忍心<rt>띰ˆ심ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>將<rt>졍ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>放<rt>방</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bo-nāi’e goà, rîm-sîm jiōng-lî-pang\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>異鄉<rt>이형ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>為<rt>위-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>夜<rt>야-</rt></ruby><ruby>夜<rt>야ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>夢<rt>빵ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    i-hiông’e goà, wi-lì ya-yā bāng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>男兒<rt>람띠ˊ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>心聲<rt>심ˉ샬ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>아<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby> <ruby>飄浪<rt>ᄑᆤˉ렁ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>運命<rt>운먀ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lam-rí sīm-siâ̰, ā phiāu-lōng’e un-miā\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>論<rt>룬-</rt></ruby><ruby>霜<rt>승ˉ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>雪<rt>셓</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>抑<rt>얗</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>風<rt>헝ˉ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>寒<rt>괄ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\"><ruby>헤<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>算<rt>승ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>啥<rt>샬ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bo-lun-sn̄g-seh, yah-si-hōng-koá̰, hè lông-bo-sǹg-sià̰\n  </span>\n</span></p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>唯一<rt>위읻</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>心疼<rt>심ˉ턀</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>心愛<rt>심ˉ애</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>在<rt>재-</rt></ruby><ruby>꾼<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>夢中<rt>빵뎡ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    wi-it’e sīm-thia̰, si-sīm-ai’e jai-gûn-bang-tiông\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>不時<rt>붇ˆ시ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>叫<rt>교</rt></ruby>’됴 <ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>名<rt>먀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    pût-sí kio’tio gùn’e miá\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>男兒<rt>람띠ˊ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>心聲<rt>심ˉ샬ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>아<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby> <ruby>飄浪<rt>ᄑᆤˉ렁ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>運命<rt>운먀ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lam-rí sīm-siâ̰, ā phiāu-lōng’e un-miā\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>論<rt>룬-</rt></ruby><ruby>霜<rt>승ˉ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>雪<rt>셓</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>抑<rt>얗</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>風<rt>헝ˉ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>寒<rt>괄ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\"><ruby>헤<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>算<rt>승ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>啥<rt>샬ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bo-lun-sn̄g-seh, yah-si-hōng-koá̰, hè lông-bo-sǹg-sià̰\n  </span>\n</span></p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>唯一<rt>위읻</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>心疼<rt>심ˉ턀</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>心愛<rt>심ˉ애</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>在<rt>재-</rt></ruby><ruby>꾼<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>夢中<rt>빵뎡ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    wi-it’e sīm-thia̰, si-sīm-ai’e jai-gûn-bang-tiông\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>不時<rt>붇ˆ시ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>叫<rt>교</rt></ruby>’됴 <ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>名<rt>먀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    pût-sí kio’tio gùn’e miá\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n"
